[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22700100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22700100_03_0010","text":"制作人，\n把手借我一下？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22700100_03_0020","text":"……？\n哦，好啊。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22700100_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22700100_03_0030","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22700100_03_0040","text":"羽那……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22700100_03_0050","text":"——谢谢。\n呵呵，咒语完成啦。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22700100_03_0060","text":"是吗……？\n是什么咒语啊？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22700100_03_0070","text":"嗯————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22700100_03_0080","text":"……首先，\n希望我不要紧张、不要搞砸。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22700100_03_0090","text":"然后，希望制作人\n能最关注我——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22700100_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22700100_03_0100","text":"那我出发啦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22700100_03_0101","text":"Motion"}]
